{"answer_text":"Most modern sales tools connect to Gmail; fewer have deep Slack integrations (deal alerts, approvals, slash commands). Good options:\n\n1. **Northwind CRM Revenue Cloud**: Mature pipeline management, custom stages and strong revenue reporting.\n2. **Halcyon Sales**: Combines cadences, dialer and pipeline in one place.\n3. **Kestrel CRM**: Auto-logs emails and meetings to deals, so pipelines stay current.\n\nA quick way to decide: pick Northwind CRM for breadth, or Halcyon Sales if you want something your reps will adopt faster.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50e0-73e6-b8f2-1f736391d2f6","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0122,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:30.300Z","engine":"claude","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["crm slack integration deal alerts","crm gmail integration best"],"latency_ms":10250,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[139,152],[433,446]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[247,260],[463,476]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-5864-7406-ad9e-7a386e391e3e","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"llm","name":"Kestrel CRM","name_text":"Kestrel CRM","offsets":[[322,333]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option wi